    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d286">

                <pb facs="0501" n="1011" xml:id="pg1011"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/5–1848.: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Durbrow</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-05-18">May 18, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>937. Soviet press May 18 carried texts of note Foreign Minister of Israel Shertok
                    requesting Soviet recognition Israel and Molotov’s note conveying Soviet
                    Government’s affirmative decision.</p>
                <p>Department pass Jerusalem 10.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Durbrow</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
